#subtitle: Setting the party's ideological direction.

= Questions of Ideology

The PPS is torn between many different ideological currents. What should be our primary ideological guidance for now?

[? if ideology != 0 : We have previously chosen a [+ ideology +] ideology. Changing it will likely have drawbacks. ?]

- @international: Explore internationalism and work with parties similar to our views.
- @centrist: Resolve our internal contradictions by remaining receptive to all factions.
- @labor: We should work with the trade unions to improve the lives of workers.
- @national: Pursue left-wing nationalism and social patriotism.
- @easy_discard

@international
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "internationalist") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "internationalist"; internationalist_strength += 8; kpp_relation += 3; internationalist_dissent -= 5; psl_w_relation -= 3; psl_p_relation -= 5; psl_w_right += 1; psl_p_right += 1; west_relation += 1

The left wing of the party supports internationalism and reconcilliation with the Communists.

@centrist
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "centrist") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "centrist"; center_strength += 8; center_dissent -= 10; internationalist_dissent -= 5; nationalist_dissent -= 5

The Center support a middle course of pragmatic foreign relations and building up the consciousness of the working class.

@labor
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "labor") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "labor"; labor_strength += 8; center_dissent += 5; labor_dissent -= 5

The labor wing of the party supports continued particpation in government in order to provide benefits to the workers, and the creation of public works programs for employment.

@national
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "nationalist") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "nationalist"; nationalist_strength += 10; democratization += 1; pps_nationalism += 2; nationalist_dissent -= 5; psl_w_relation += 5; psl_p_relation += 5; psl_p_left += 1; kpp_relation -= 8

The nationalist wing of the party seeks to protect the Republic and the democratic system of government, and is most supportive of coalitions with the other pro-democratic and nationalist parties.

@changed
on-arrival: internationalist_issent += 5; center_dissent += 5; labor_dissent += 5; nationalist_dissent += 5

We have changed ideologies. Many in the party feel unmoored.
